          "id": 2562663502,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "As explained in https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/wikis/Development/SubmittingPatches, you need to create a specific branch and rebase using `git pull --rebase` so that we do not end with merge commits like the one you currently have. Currently we can't merge it.\nGiven the current dissector style, the enhancement suggested by Alexis is not mandatory (and there is no `proto_tree_add_uint_format_ret_uint` anyway).\nWhile you are in the area, it would be great to change your commit message to add a \"SCSI:\" prefix as Alexis did for the merge request title.",
